<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Our God is enterable,</l><l>And He’s enjoyable,</l><l>Our Christ—He is the way,</l><l>We eat Him ev’ry day!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Center of centers ’tis,</l><l>The hidden manna is.</l><l>Our deepest life supply;</l><l>How He does satisfy!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Don’t trust the circumstance,</l><l>For it is just the chance</l><l>To get more God in you,</l><l>Become Him through and through!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Spend time alone with Him,</l><l>Just love Him, talk to Him;</l><l>By this we’re deified</l><l>And we become His Bride!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
